WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:11.267
When a severe storm or power outage knocks out cellular antennas, SENDA continues running inside your mobile browser without requiring app store downloads or internet access.

2
00:00:11.617 --> 00:00:21.387
Every emergency SOS and safety status is encrypted on your device and relayed using acoustic soundwaves and short-range radio to nearby neighbours.

3
00:00:22.987 --> 00:00:33.185
Moving vehicles and pedestrians serve as data couriers, advancing emergency messages hop-by-hop across miles until reaching a gateway with external connectivity.

4
00:00:33.535 --> 00:00:43.967
Simultaneously, the 3D elevation map computes safe evacuation corridors, steering families away from flood basins and fire fronts using high-resolution terrain models.

5
00:00:45.567 --> 00:00:55.935
During critical emergencies, there is no time for complex menus. SENDA provides three immediate buttons: I'm safe, I need help, or I'm trapped with your exact coordinates.

6
00:00:56.285 --> 00:01:03.623
A public, accessible, and humane utility ensuring that no citizen remains unheard in the darkest hour of a catastrophe.
